322	    /** A steward re-settles a SETTLED claim: its due is fixed again at the figure it would have today as an open
323	     *  claim bound by no statement (its live figure at today's rates, grades and floor, with the late charge it
324	     *  would have gained by today on top), and its status log gains a SETTLED line. Refused for a clerk, for a
325	     *  claim that is not SETTLED and for one dated inside a closed period. */
326	    @Transactional
